//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//* KAFKA CONNECT ON Z: DISTRIBUTED WORKER STARTED TASK
//* GENERATED BY FSI-DSP SCENARIOS/MQ-QUICKSTART. CHANGE INPUTS.YML
//* AND RE-RUN THE PLAYBOOK INSTEAD OF EDITING THIS MEMBER.
//*
//* PGM, NOT SH: UNDER SH, /ETC/PROFILE AND .PROFILE RUN AND OVERRIDE
//* THE STDENV FILE. NO SYMBOLICS: EVERY VALUE IS RESOLVED UP FRONT,
//* SO PARM IS CHECKED AGAINST THE 100-CHARACTER LIMIT BEFORE UPLOAD.
//*
//* START: S {{ stc_name }}   STOP: P {{ stc_name }}   FORCE: C {{ stc_name }}
